\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces S\&P~500 universe: 495 assets, 1192 trading days (Jul~2021--May~2026). Speedup relative to \texttt  {cvxpy} within each panel. ``Clarabel (direct API)'' calls the same interior-point solver without CVXPY's overhead; $>95\%$ of \texttt  {cvxpy}'s time is Python interface work. NNLS is slower with shrinkage because the augmented matrix grows from $T \times n$ to $(T+n) \times n$.}}{10}{table.11}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:sp500}{{3}{10}{S\&P~500 universe: 495 assets, 1192 trading days (Jul~2021--May~2026). Speedup relative to \texttt {cvxpy} within each panel. ``Clarabel (direct API)'' calls the same interior-point solver without CVXPY's overhead; $>95\%$ of \texttt {cvxpy}'s time is Python interface work. NNLS is slower with shrinkage because the augmented matrix grows from $T \times n$ to $(T+n) \times n$}{table.11}{}}
